@startuml Daily_Review_Session_Sequence
actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "Интерфейс" as UI
participant "Контроллер" as Controller
participant "Сервис карточек" as CardService
participant "Алгоритм SM-2" as SM2Algorithm
participant "Сервис статистики" as StatsService
participant "База данных" as DB

' === УТРЕННИЙ ОБЗОР КАРТОЧЕК ===
note over User, DB: Утренний обзор карточек для повторения

User -> UI: Открывает приложение для повторения
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Controller: GET /api/cards/due-today
activate Controller

Controller -> CardService: getCardsDueForReview(user_id)
activate CardService

CardService -> DB: SELECT * FROM cards\nWHERE next_review <= NOW()\nAND user_id = ?\nORDER BY next_review ASC
activate DB
DB -> CardService: due_cards
deactivate DB

CardService -> CardService: prioritizeCards(due_cards)
activate CardService
CardService -> Controller: DailyReviewResponse(cards)
deactivate CardService

Controller -> UI: 200 OK\n {due_cards: [...], count: X}
deactivate Controller

UI -> UI: Отобразить "Карточки для повторения сегодня"
UI -> UI: Показать прогресс-бар (X из Y)
UI -> User: Показать первую карточку для повторения

' === СЕССИЯ ПОВТОРЕНИЯ ===
note over User, DB: Сессия повторения карточек

loop Для каждой карточки в сессии
    User -> UI: Оценивает знание карточки (0-5)
    UI -> Controller: POST /api/cards/{id}/review\n {rating: 0..5}
    activate Controller
    
    Controller -> CardService: processReview(card_id, rating)
    activate CardService
    
    CardService -> DB: SELECT * FROM cards WHERE id = card_id
    activate DB
    DB -> CardService: card_data
    deactivate DB
    
    CardService -> SM2Algorithm: calculateNextInterval(rating, card_data)
    activate SM2Algorithm
    SM2Algorithm -> CardService: {new_interval, next_review_date}
    deactivate SM2Algorithm
    
    CardService -> DB: UPDATE cards SET\ninterval_days = new_interval,\nnext_review = next_review_date,\nreview_count = review_count + 1\nWHERE id = card_id
    activate DB
    DB -> CardService: success
    deactivate DB
    
    CardService -> StatsService: trackReview(card_id, rating, timestamp)
    activate StatsService
    StatsService --> CardService: tracked
    deactivate StatsService
    
    CardService -> Controller: SuccessResponse(next_review_date)
    deactivate CardService
    
    Controller -> UI: 200 OK\n {next_review, cards_remaining}
    deactivate Controller
    
    UI -> UI: Обновить прогресс сессии
    alt Карточки еще остались
        UI -> User: Показать следующую карточку
    else Все карточки пройдены
        UI -> User: Показать "Сессия завершена!"
    end
end

' === ВЕЧЕРНЯЯ СТАТИСТИКА ===
note over User, DB: Вечерняя статистика и аналитика

User -> UI: Запрашивает отчет о сессии
UI -> Controller: GET /api/stats/daily-session
activate Controller

Controller -> StatsService: getSessionStats(user_id, date)
activate StatsService

StatsService -> DB: SELECT\nCOUNT(*) as reviewed_today,\nAVG(rating) as avg_score,\nSUM(CASE WHEN rating >= 4 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as well_known\nFROM review_logs\nWHERE user_id = ? AND DATE(timestamp) = TODAY()
activate DB
DB -> StatsService: stats_data
deactivate DB

StatsService -> DB: SELECT deck_name, COUNT(*) as cards_reviewed\nFROM cards c\nJOIN decks d ON c.deck_id = d.id\nWHERE c.last_reviewed >= TODAY()\nAND c.user_id = ?\nGROUP BY deck_id
activate DB
DB -> StatsService: deck_stats
deactivate DB

StatsService -> Controller: SessionStatsReport(stats_data, deck_stats)
deactivate StatsService

Controller -> UI: 200 OK\n {reviewed_today, avg_score, well_known, deck_stats}
deactivate Controller

UI -> UI: Сгенерировать визуальный отчет с графиками
UI -> User: Показать достижения за сессию\nи рекомендации на завтра

deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml
